WEBVTT

00:11:56.579 --> 00:12:00.496
You watch the development of
an infant, for example,

00:12:00.496 --> 00:12:05.787
you see the young ones watching and
at first they don't even try.

00:12:06.121 --> 00:12:09.162
Then they use an inappropriate tool.

00:12:09.496 --> 00:12:15.996
Then they use I mean, one one little
infant quite determined that she was

00:12:15.996 --> 00:12:20.621
going to really try and do what her mom
was doing, having watched her mom.

00:12:21.162 --> 00:12:26.121
And she she got this thick little stick,
which was much too thick,

00:12:26.371 --> 00:12:29.329
but she pushed and pushed and
it went down into the hole

00:12:29.329 --> 00:12:33.079
or she couldn't get it out.
And it was just so funny.